# Files excluded from `phr-mcp audit`. Gitignore values.
#
# This file lives at project root and is read by `audit` (not by the
# hook, which only sees diffs). Add paths whose contents legitimately
# embed rule-trigger strings — for example, files that define rules.
#
# An entry here exempts a file from lexical rules only (rules with no
# AST predicate); structural rules still run on it below the
# PHRONESIS_MAX_FILE_BYTES cap, and `phr-mcp audit` names every excluded
# file in its footer and under `lexical_excluded` in --json.
